              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Lasblaster" id="0810-7fd5-15e0-e716" hidden="false">
              <description>May fire 3 shots per shooting phase in the same way as a Scatter laser. All 3 targets must be within 6&quot; of each other. 
Weapon may also be used in melee with its own profile</description>
